Verdict: **BLOCKED — required source-unavailable fault could not be induced by
the least-invasive reversible source operation**. No card-profile removal,
source rename, source replacement, server restart, or unrelated audio mutation
was attempted. The inspected implementation makes the blocker deterministic:
`CaptureHandle::start` only calls the `parec` process spawn boundary; endpoint
absence is discovered later by `read_frame`. A missing-source mutation would
therefore not enter the `Starting` retry path, and could instead surface as a
read failure after `Streaming`.

